%N A400071 Number of compositions (ordered partitions) of n such that (greatest part) - (least part) >= 2.
%F A400071 G.f.: x / (1 - 2*x) - Sum_{j>=1} x^j / ( (1 - x^j - x^(j+1)) * (1 - x^(j+1)) ).
%e A400071 a(5) = 5 because we have [4,1], [3,1,1], [1,3,1], [1,1,3] and [1,4].
%t A400071 nmax = 35; CoefficientList[Series[x/(1 - 2 x) - Sum[x^j/((1 - x^j - x^(j + 1)) (1 - x^(j + 1))), {j, 1, nmax}], {x, 0, nmax}], x] // Rest
